('MIDDLE-F02', 'minimum_viable_repair', 'THE MINIMUM VIABLE REPAIR', 'Your ideal repair styles differ, so the court selected the smallest move neither person dislikes.', 'No grand apology tour required. Consideration remains mandatory.', 'Acknowledge the impact, then use the lowest-pressure shared repair.', 'Bunny Court found our minimum viable reschedule apology.', 'Warm and playful; remove humor if submitted content raises emotional weight.'),
