('LOVE-04', 'imbalance', 'RECIPROCAL CHANNEL MATCH', 'initiation_channels, desired_channel, barrier, easy_action', 'Compare channels and unmet preferences. Do not treat frequency as love. A matched desired channel becomes the Court-Ordered Move; a clear imbalance produces a gentle turn-taking experiment.', 'balanced → imbalance → missed_channel', 'Not balanced AND absolute difference in initiation-channel counts ≥ 2; assign the quieter initiator one selected easy_action.', 'A balanced answer or tied mapping resolves to balanced; use both selected easy actions.', 'ONE PERSON HAS BEEN CARRYING THE CLIPBOARD', 'This is a handoff problem, not a love problem.', 'The quieter initiator chooses and starts one easy action this week.'),
