('LOVE-F01', 'double_match', 'RECIPROCAL CHANNEL MATCH', 'receive_style, give_style, available_move', 'Compare A.give_style with B.receive_style and B.give_style with A.receive_style. Two matches = double_match; one match = one_match; zero matches = reroute. Court-Ordered Move uses each person’s available_move only when it matches the other person’s receive_style; otherwise use the closest selected receive style.', 'double_match → one_match → reroute', 'hits = [A.give_style = B.receive_style] + [B.give_style = A.receive_style] = 2.', 'If available moves do not map, name the selected receive style without inventing an action.', 'THE LOVE RECEIPTS MATCH', 'No translation needed. Your tiny affection delivery system is operational.', 'Repeat one of those little things this week—on purpose this time.'),
('LOVE-F01', 'one_match', 'RECIPROCAL CHANNEL MATCH', 'receive_style, give_style, available_move', 'Compare A.give_style with B.receive_style and B.give_style with A.receive_style. Two matches = double_match; one match = one_match; zero matches = reroute. Court-Ordered Move uses each person’s available_move only when it matches the other person’s receive_style; otherwise use the closest selected receive style.', 'double_match → one_match → reroute', 'reciprocal hits = 1.', 'If available moves do not map, name the selected receive style without inventing an action.', 'ONE DELIVERY LANDED PERFECTLY', 'Half the system is psychic. Half just needs the correct address.', 'Each choose one move from the other person’s answer this week.'),
