('LIFE-F01', 'tiny_touchpoint', 'CAPACITY-CEILING RECIPE', 'battery, channel, desired_benefit', 'Use the lower battery level as the time ceiling, choose an overlapping location/channel, and apply the selected benefit. Output tiny_touchpoint, shared_reset or solo_reset. Never assign a call when either selects solo or text only.', 'solo_reset → tiny_touchpoint → shared_reset', 'No solo override AND lower battery is low, or only text/voice-note overlap exists.', 'No channel overlap becomes solo reset with one no-reply-needed signal.', 'TEN-MINUTE CONNECTION LICENSE', 'No full performance required. Court permits one small human moment.', 'Use the available channel for ten minutes or less, then release each other.'),
