('LIFE-F02', 'quick_outing', 'ACTIVITY MATRIX', 'duration, habitat, vibe', 'Cross time, compatible habitat and vibe through a fixed activity matrix. If habitats do not overlap, use remote. If either time is 10 minutes, cap at 10. Output remote_microdate, quick_outing or slow_evening.', 'remote_microdate → quick_outing → slow_evening', 'Shared nearby/outdoor habitat AND available-time ceiling is below a full evening.', 'No habitat overlap becomes remote; no vibe overlap uses the lower-stimulation option.', 'THE ONE-STOP DATE', 'One destination has been granted. Side quests require a new filing.', 'Choose one place and finish while the energy is still good.'),
