('LIFE-F03', 'clean_swap', 'FAIR CHORE ASSIGNMENT', 'hated_chore, tolerated_chores, recent_load', 'Never assign a person’s top-hated chore when the other lists it as tolerable. Weight recent workload: if both agree one carried more, give that person first pick; if disputed or unknown, rotate. Output clean_swap, first_pick or rotation.', 'clean_swap → first_pick → rotation', 'A.hated = B.tolerable and/or B.hated = A.tolerable.', 'Never assign a hated chore when the other tolerates it; unresolved chores rotate.', 'A DOMESTIC TRADE HAS BEEN APPROVED', 'This is less romance and more excellent resource allocation.', 'Swap the two matched chores for this round.'),
