('MIDDLE-F02', 'shared_protocol', 'REPAIR PROTOCOL', 'notice, sting_trigger, repair', 'Build a fixed protocol using the stricter notice preference, each person’s sting trigger and selected repair. Same repair = shared_protocol; compatible repairs = two_step; conflicting capacity = minimum_viable_repair. Never decide whether a cancellation was morally justified.', 'shared_protocol → two_step → minimum_viable_repair', 'repair choices match and address both sting triggers.', 'Choose the smallest repair neither person rejects; if none, return no agreement.', 'THE RESCHEDULE BUTTON IS NOW SAFER', 'The plan may move. The care does not have to disappear with it.', 'Use your shared notice rule and repair move next time.'),
